      <dct:title xml:lang="en">Recruitment Match Ontology (RMO) - core</dct:title>
      <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Core Recruitment Match Vocabulary - core</rdfs:label>
      <dct:description xml:lang="en">The Recruitment Match Ontology core describes the concepts and properties representing the Recruitment domain. The provision of these semantics offers the basis for a common understanding of the domain for all stakeholders ensuring the quality of data exchange and transparency. The ontology restrictions are published in a separate artefact.</dct:description>
